%% Flow: register an account, provision its wallet, activate by email, then log in.
%% Solid arrow = synchronous call. Dashed arrow = return, async or fire-and-forget.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Trader browser
    participant GW as deploy/gateway.mjs
    participant AR as routes/auth.route.js
    participant AC as auth.controller.js
    participant UM as models/User.js
    participant MU as MongoDB _user
    participant WG as grpc/walletService.js
    participant WA as walletapi createAsset.js
    participant MW as MongoDB _wallet
    participant RD as Redis
    participant RS as Resend API

    Note over T,RS: REGISTRATION

    T->>GW: POST /api/auth/register email, password, confirmPassword, roleType 1
    GW->>AR: forwarded to userapi
    AR->>AR: registerValidate - regex, length 8-18, confirm match
    AR->>AC: createNewUser
    AC->>MU: findOne by lowercased email
    alt verified duplicate
        AC-->>T: 400 Email already exists
    else unverified duplicate older than 24h
        AC->>MU: delete stale user and its UserSetting, continue
    else unverified duplicate younger than 24h
        AC-->>T: 400 wait N hours
    end
    AC->>UM: set password virtual
    UM->>UM: makeSalt then pbkdf2 sha512, 100000 iters, 128 bytes
    AC->>MU: save user - userId and refferalCode from IncCntObjId
    AC-->>MU: defaultUserSetting - not awaited, errors swallowed

    Note over T,RS: WALLET PROVISIONING - fire and forget on BOTH sides

    AC-->>WG: newAsset userId, userCode - NOT awaited
    WG->>WA: gRPC NewAsset
    WA-->>WG: status true returned BEFORE the wallet exists
    WA->>MW: create wallet with _id = user._id
    WA->>MW: push assets for DEMO_SEED_COINS USD, spotBal 1000
    WA->>RD: hset walletbalance_spot userId_currencyId 1000
    WA->>RD: updateUserWallet - HSETNX hydrate, never overwrite

    Note over T,RS: ACTIVATION

    AC-->>RS: mailTemplateLang activate_register_user - NOT awaited
    RS-->>T: email with FRONT_URL /verification/register?auth=token
    T->>GW: POST /api/auth/confirm-mail with mailToken
    GW->>AC: confirmMail
    AC->>MU: match mailToken, flip emailStatus to verified

    Note over T,RS: LOGIN

    T->>GW: POST /api/auth/login
    GW->>AC: userLogin
    AC->>UM: authenticate - re-derive pbkdf2, plain string compare
    alt TEST_MODE is true
        AC->>AC: skip OTP entirely
    else normal
        AC-->>RS: email a six digit login code
    end
    AC->>AC: sign JWT with SECRET_KEY, embed tokenId
    AC->>RD: hset userToken row with tokenId - revokes prior session
    AC-->>T: token, stored in 4 places by the browser
